WEBVTT

00:00.790 --> 00:06.010
The Witch Hat World Tree is one of the 
Aradia Kingdom's tourist hot spots.

00:06.010 --> 00:09.450
It is a thousand years old 
and stands 900 meters tall.

00:09.930 --> 00:13.050
Beyond the tunnel is...

00:15.600 --> 00:19.180
the Royal Diana Academy of Magic.

01:51.030 --> 01:56.890
Diana was established roughly a thousand 
years ago by the founding witch, Selene.

01:57.260 --> 02:02.010
Between its middle school and high school 
divisions, it has over 600 students.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.740
Wow, wow!

02:04.740 --> 02:07.650
I'm actually at Diana!

02:08.600 --> 02:10.580
Everything about this place is so pretty!

02:10.580 --> 02:12.820
Everyone's so elegant and distinguished.

02:12.820 --> 02:14.820
No wonder, given this 
school's so prestigious!

02:14.820 --> 02:17.530
And the uniforms are so cute.

02:17.530 --> 02:20.410
Wait, I'm wearing the same one!

02:21.510 --> 02:23.010
Calm down.

02:23.010 --> 02:24.460
Your stupid is showing.

02:24.460 --> 02:25.790
Master!

02:25.790 --> 02:27.840
Call me Professor Claude.

02:27.840 --> 02:31.410
Remember, no one can know 
that you're my apprentice.

02:31.410 --> 02:33.360
Sure, sure.

02:33.360 --> 02:38.210
So is it a secret that you transform 
into a cute little kitty, too?

02:38.210 --> 02:39.780
Obviously!

02:39.780 --> 02:44.040
Then please be careful not to use up 
your magic and turn back into a cat.

02:44.040 --> 02:46.300
I don't like it either, you know.

02:46.520 --> 02:49.680
You made me kiss your 
butt this morning, too.

02:49.680 --> 02:52.260
It's super embarrassing, 
even knowing that it's

02:52.260 --> 02:54.270
so that you can get back 
to your human form.

02:54.590 --> 02:55.630
Does it bother you?

02:55.630 --> 02:57.290
Of course it does!

02:57.290 --> 03:00.810
It's embarrassing for me, too, and I 
feel bad making you do that for me.

03:00.810 --> 03:04.710
But I couldn't teach as a cat, could I?

03:04.710 --> 03:06.950
W-Well, yeah...

03:06.950 --> 03:10.510
In any case, we ought to cooperate.

03:10.510 --> 03:15.810
Our goal is the same: to make 
you a first-class magician.

03:15.810 --> 03:18.170
I know, but...

03:18.170 --> 03:21.370
Let us work together 
toward our common dream!

03:21.370 --> 03:25.590
I feel like I'm being 
hoodwinked by a bad man.

03:26.050 --> 03:30.800
Also, I'll talk to the principal 
about your coven. Don't worry.

03:31.100 --> 03:32.830
My coven?

03:33.260 --> 03:34.740
You don't know what that is?

03:34.740 --> 03:36.840
You should if you're 
going to a magic school.

03:36.840 --> 03:40.440
Well, I was going to 
a normal school before.

03:40.440 --> 03:41.770
A coven is...

03:41.770 --> 03:43.000
Mr. Sirius.

03:43.390 --> 03:47.250
Already making friends with your 
students? Impressive as always.

03:47.250 --> 03:49.620
It's been a while, Principal Jeanne.

03:49.620 --> 03:50.960
Now he's acting proper!

03:50.960 --> 03:52.880
Also, the principal's so young!

03:52.880 --> 03:56.620
The school's abuzz with 
word of your return.

03:56.620 --> 03:58.250
Abuzz, huh?

03:58.250 --> 03:59.080
Yes.

03:59.310 --> 04:01.640
Though it's mostly people 
badmouthing you.

04:01.980 --> 04:03.560
The principal's a sadist!

04:04.860 --> 04:06.630
That hurts to hear.

04:06.630 --> 04:09.480
I don't want to cause any 
confusion among the students.

04:09.480 --> 04:13.560
May I ask you to wait in my office 
until the covens are announced?

04:13.850 --> 04:17.180
I just happened to have an 
inquiry regarding the covens.

04:17.180 --> 04:20.110
Oh, what might it be? 
I can't wait to hear.

04:20.310 --> 04:21.780
I'll figure it out with her.

04:21.780 --> 04:22.980
Stay out of trouble.

04:22.980 --> 04:24.580
No, you!

04:24.580 --> 04:26.340
Well, let's go.

04:25.250 --> 04:28.050
I wonder if those two are friends.

04:28.760 --> 04:32.100
Where the hell did you 
wander off to for two years?

04:32.100 --> 04:35.490
Don't you run away this time, 
my dumbass apprentice.

04:35.490 --> 04:37.900
Well, well, Master Jeanne.

04:37.900 --> 04:41.260
You're just as beautiful 
as you were two years ago.

04:41.260 --> 04:43.760
What kind of magic is that?

04:43.760 --> 04:46.030
You'd best watch your tone.

04:46.030 --> 04:49.650
I only gave you your job back 
out of the kindness of my heart.

04:50.010 --> 04:51.710
I'm grateful for that.

04:51.710 --> 04:54.690
Wait, maybe they aren't.

04:55.570 --> 04:59.790
Shoot, I didn't get to 
find out what a coven was.

04:59.790 --> 05:02.660
What do I do now?

05:00.720 --> 05:02.660
Somebody!

05:02.660 --> 05:04.770
Is anyone there?!

05:04.770 --> 05:06.530
How did this even happen?!

05:06.530 --> 05:07.510
I...

05:07.510 --> 05:10.100
I slipped and fell and 
ended up in the wall!

05:10.100 --> 05:11.490
Is that a thing?!

05:11.490 --> 05:13.250
Could you please pull me out?

05:13.470 --> 05:14.780
Okay, I guess...

05:14.780 --> 05:15.780
Here I go.

05:15.780 --> 05:17.460
One, two...

05:18.620 --> 05:20.060
You won't come out!

05:20.060 --> 05:22.020
My breasts are stuck!

05:28.760 --> 05:30.060
Thanks.

05:30.060 --> 05:32.300
You're my savior.

05:32.300 --> 05:34.880
A sexy lady appears!

05:35.240 --> 05:37.390
I'm Io Taurus.

05:37.390 --> 05:38.500
And you?

05:39.080 --> 05:41.850
I'm Spica Virgo, a first-year.

05:41.850 --> 05:43.740
You're in my year!

05:43.740 --> 05:45.940
Nice to meet you, Spica!

05:43.740 --> 05:45.390
She's in my year?

05:47.910 --> 05:50.610
My... year?

05:50.610 --> 05:52.820
I hope we're in the same coven.

05:52.820 --> 05:56.340
Um, so... what's a coven?

05:56.340 --> 05:59.300
I came from a normal school, 
so I don't really know.

06:00.170 --> 06:02.620
A coven is your class.

06:03.360 --> 06:08.500
A coven at Diana consists of 
twelve students and a teacher.

06:08.500 --> 06:12.140
They spend three years studying, 
eating, and living together.

06:12.140 --> 06:13.840
Three whole years?

06:13.840 --> 06:16.440
Who you end up with is 
really important, then.

06:16.440 --> 06:17.880
It is.

06:17.880 --> 06:21.740
So when Master said he'd 
take care of my coven,

06:21.740 --> 06:24.970
he meant he'd put me in his coven.

06:24.970 --> 06:29.290
I hope I'm with nice people.

06:29.290 --> 06:32.140
I've been at Diana since middle school.

06:32.140 --> 06:34.400
Everyone here is kind and diligent.

06:34.400 --> 06:37.720
I guess, huh? This school's prestigious.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.200
Exactly.

06:39.590 --> 06:42.090
Our covens should be announced soon.

06:42.090 --> 06:43.680
Wanna go check the bulletin boards?

06:43.680 --> 06:44.920
Okay.

06:46.580 --> 06:47.680
Sorry!

06:49.140 --> 06:50.290
Hey...

06:50.290 --> 06:52.260
Are you hurt? Let me get a good look.

06:52.260 --> 06:54.210
Huh?! N-No, I'm fine.

06:54.210 --> 06:55.590
Thank goodness.

06:55.590 --> 06:58.600
If someone as beautiful 
as you were to be hurt...

06:58.600 --> 06:59.970
B-Beautiful?!

06:59.970 --> 07:01.840
Beautiful? Aw...

07:01.840 --> 07:03.230
Am I?

07:03.230 --> 07:04.270
Hi there.

07:04.270 --> 07:06.740
You're as beautiful as a goddess, too.

07:06.740 --> 07:08.950
I'm Libra. Nice to meet you.

07:08.950 --> 07:10.700
He's just a horndog!

07:11.130 --> 07:13.700
Oh, let's speak again later.

07:13.700 --> 07:16.410
Ma'am, you dropped your handkerchief.

07:16.410 --> 07:18.910
No, she didn't.

07:18.910 --> 07:20.910
What's wrong with him? 
Is he a pick-up artist?

07:20.910 --> 07:22.210
Libra...

07:22.210 --> 07:24.590
I heard he's the vice principal's son.

07:24.590 --> 07:26.880
That scary-looking vice principal?

07:27.160 --> 07:30.080
Is this school okay?

07:30.080 --> 07:32.600
You there, beautiful miss.

07:32.920 --> 07:35.970
Sorry, I lied about your handkerchief.

07:35.970 --> 07:37.570
I just wanted to talk to you.

07:37.570 --> 07:40.160
Should we stop him?

07:40.160 --> 07:41.520
Oh, it's fine.

07:41.520 --> 07:44.300
I've known these people 
since middle school.

07:44.300 --> 07:45.150
That girl...

07:48.870 --> 07:52.040
I mean, Castor's a boy.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.660
Who the hell are you calling "miss"?

07:53.660 --> 07:55.710
I'm gonna smash your head in.

07:55.710 --> 07:57.050
You're right!

07:57.050 --> 07:58.920
I just realized he's wearing pants.

07:58.920 --> 08:01.160
How did I get it wrong?

08:02.600 --> 08:04.350
That's odd.

08:04.350 --> 08:06.740
Sorry, looks like I made a mistake.

08:06.740 --> 08:08.570
Nope. I'm making you pay.

08:08.570 --> 08:11.980
Are you really that upset just 
because I thought you were a girl?

08:11.980 --> 08:12.960
That's not it!

08:13.250 --> 08:16.520
I'm pissed that you touched 
me with your filthy hands.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.440
I'll kill you, you manslut.

08:18.680 --> 08:20.610
What are you, a clean freak?

08:20.610 --> 08:23.260
How could you call me dirty? That hurts.

08:23.260 --> 08:24.940
I think I'll have you apologize.

08:24.940 --> 08:26.390
Wait, you two!

08:26.390 --> 08:28.770
You there, no fighting.

08:30.990 --> 08:31.910
Who's she?

08:33.820 --> 08:36.170
Fighting is bad.

08:36.170 --> 08:38.280
You'll draw everyone's attention.

08:39.340 --> 08:42.160
And no one takes the spotlight from me!

08:42.160 --> 08:43.660
Holy crap, her body!

08:43.660 --> 08:47.030
Well, well, if it isn't the Regulus lady.

08:47.030 --> 08:48.830
Why make your entrance from a chandelier?

08:48.830 --> 08:50.250
A foolish question.

08:50.250 --> 08:51.390
To draw attention!

08:51.390 --> 08:52.830
She sounds dumb!

08:53.370 --> 08:54.730
You're in my way.

08:54.730 --> 08:56.800
Get lost, meathead lady.

08:57.020 --> 09:01.760
If you insist on fighting, 
I'll have to stop you by force.

09:02.650 --> 09:05.230
I can't stand brutes.

09:05.230 --> 09:07.780
I wonder what we're having for lunch.

09:07.780 --> 09:10.770
I thought Diana was 
full of diligent students!

09:10.770 --> 09:13.230
This isn't what I was promised!

09:15.310 --> 09:18.940
Libra Magic: Eye of Themis.

09:18.940 --> 09:20.740
The hell are you closing your eyes for?!

09:22.170 --> 09:27.110
I don't need my eyes open 
to dodge your attacks.

09:27.110 --> 09:29.010
Stuff it.

09:29.010 --> 09:32.010
Gemini Magic: Mirror Augment!

09:33.770 --> 09:36.160
Save your bragging for after you've won.

09:36.540 --> 09:38.400
Violence is so barbaric!

09:37.550 --> 09:39.560
I appreciate the warning.

09:38.400 --> 09:39.550
Someone, get a teacher!

09:39.550 --> 09:43.960
How dare you show off without me?

09:43.960 --> 09:46.720
Leo Magic: Lion Queen!

09:48.550 --> 09:51.150
If you really want to fight...

09:51.770 --> 09:54.790
I'll be happy to take you on.

09:55.430 --> 09:58.790
I don't mind an invitation 
from a beautiful lady,

09:58.790 --> 10:01.160
but I'll pass this time.

10:01.160 --> 10:05.350
I need to keep my distance from these 
people for the next three years.

10:05.820 --> 10:07.120
Are you okay?!

10:08.720 --> 10:10.460
I'm totally fine.

10:10.460 --> 10:12.230
I'm a tough girl.

10:12.230 --> 10:13.970
You have a bump on your head!

10:14.230 --> 10:15.970
What have you done to my savior?!

10:15.970 --> 10:17.420
Now I'm angry!

10:17.750 --> 10:18.880
Io...

10:19.230 --> 10:20.890
Taurus Magic...

10:26.950 --> 10:28.420
Gugalanna!

10:29.020 --> 10:31.390
Please stop fighting!

10:31.390 --> 10:33.740
Holy crap, that's so showy!

10:33.740 --> 10:34.730
I'm jealous!

10:34.730 --> 10:37.460
The women here are all freaks.

10:37.460 --> 10:40.030
Bigger is better, right?

10:40.030 --> 10:41.990
Io, your behind!

10:41.990 --> 10:43.220
You're showing!

10:43.970 --> 10:45.220
I'm sorry!

10:45.220 --> 10:46.030
Ow!

10:46.030 --> 10:49.540
Incoming dump truck!

10:54.430 --> 10:55.850
Good grief.

10:55.850 --> 10:58.050
You shouldn't be running wild at school.

10:58.640 --> 11:00.240
M-Master—

11:00.240 --> 11:01.830
Professor Claude!

11:01.830 --> 11:03.380
Why the hell are you here?!

11:03.650 --> 11:06.220
Why? To collect you, of course.

11:08.140 --> 11:11.140
Castor Gemini, Astraea Libra,

11:11.480 --> 11:13.930
Wow, I'm in the air! This is fun!

11:11.710 --> 11:16.820
Leo Regulus, Io Taurus, Spica Virgo...

11:17.690 --> 11:19.800
You're now in the Claude Coven.

11:20.270 --> 11:22.150
You're my students.

11:24.120 --> 11:27.130
I'm in the same coven as these people?!

11:28.810 --> 11:32.110
How am I going to get through 
the next three years?!

11:33.220 --> 11:37.090
Claude, I understand your situation.

11:37.440 --> 11:40.690
You're my former apprentice, 
so I'll let you return.

11:40.690 --> 11:43.470
I'll even let you have 
Spica in your coven.

11:43.800 --> 11:48.260
But the public won't accept it so easily.

11:48.580 --> 11:52.970
True or not, the rumor that you fled

11:52.970 --> 11:55.700
has the students suspicious of you.

11:55.700 --> 11:58.220
You're no longer in the 
same position as before.

11:59.250 --> 12:04.490
So, in order to dispel their 
doubts, I'll give you a test.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.580
A test?

12:05.900 --> 12:09.790
I've chosen students with high 
potential for your Claude Coven.

12:10.150 --> 12:12.920
But they're each a little troublesome.

12:13.480 --> 12:16.370
You'll bring these twelve 
students together.

12:16.680 --> 12:19.350
Come on, Ewe, wake up. The teacher's here.

12:21.790 --> 12:24.750
I feel like something fantastic 
is about to happen.

12:24.750 --> 12:27.470
Everyone looks so goofy.

12:27.470 --> 12:30.430
Chiron, you shouldn't say that.

12:31.110 --> 12:32.640
Waste of time.

12:32.890 --> 12:37.090
Wow, I'm in Spica's coven. Hilarious.

12:37.830 --> 12:41.350
You are to make sure everyone 
graduates. No dropouts.

12:41.890 --> 12:44.340
I'll have you leave if you don't succeed.

12:45.280 --> 12:48.150
To think I'm back at this podium...

12:48.150 --> 12:49.400
Very well.

12:49.400 --> 12:51.900
I'll take care of all of them.

12:51.900 --> 12:54.590
This is the beginning 
of my new teaching life.

12:57.730 --> 12:59.690
Huh? Where's the teacher?

13:02.210 --> 13:03.490
So cute!

13:03.490 --> 13:04.550
It's a cat.

13:04.550 --> 13:05.920
Why is it here?

13:06.590 --> 13:07.970
You're kidding me.

13:08.260 --> 13:11.850
Looks like I used up all my 
magic levitating that big body.

13:11.850 --> 13:14.230
I told you to be careful!

13:14.230 --> 13:15.880
Spica?

13:16.560 --> 13:19.270
Cure my curse again, please?

13:19.270 --> 13:21.170
No!

13:21.170 --> 13:22.490
Weird chick.

13:22.490 --> 13:24.430
Claude Coven, day one.

13:24.430 --> 13:26.420
Spica Virgo flees.

13:26.420 --> 13:29.860
Due to Mr. Claude's absence, 
class is canceled.

13:31.750 --> 13:33.950
Spica, it's morning.

13:33.950 --> 13:35.070
Wake up.

13:35.800 --> 13:38.500
Lemme sleep a little longer.

13:42.490 --> 13:43.850
Okay.

13:43.850 --> 13:46.370
I'll take you to school.

13:46.370 --> 13:47.550
I'll get up!

13:47.550 --> 13:49.720
I'll get up! Just let me down!

13:50.370 --> 13:52.430
I'm sorry!

13:52.820 --> 13:54.240
Morning.

13:54.240 --> 13:56.010
Morning, Dorm Mother.

13:56.440 --> 13:58.200
Good morning.

13:58.570 --> 14:02.350
So you were the ones making 
a racket this morning.

13:58.940 --> 14:00.890
Give it back, Ewe!

14:00.890 --> 14:03.220
Chiron, eat your peppers.

14:02.350 --> 14:05.290
You spoiled my elegant tea time.

14:03.220 --> 14:04.920
Shut up! You're not my mom!

14:05.270 --> 14:06.850
Oh, sorry.

14:06.850 --> 14:08.790
I'm glad you understand.

14:09.150 --> 14:10.080
No cup?!

14:10.080 --> 14:11.570
What happened to your elegance?!

14:11.920 --> 14:18.320
There's something I have to do every 
morning while the others have breakfast.

14:12.790 --> 14:14.730
It all smells great!

14:14.730 --> 14:16.680
What should I have?

14:19.800 --> 14:20.920
You're late!

14:20.920 --> 14:23.990
Is that how you ask someone for help?

14:28.750 --> 14:31.950
I can't stand kissing you every morning!

14:33.140 --> 14:35.520
Isn't there anything you can do?

14:35.520 --> 14:37.340
What we know right now is...

14:37.340 --> 14:40.850
The moment I use any 
serious magic, I become a cat.

14:40.850 --> 14:46.100
And by day's end, your Rebirth Magic 
wears off, making me turn back into a cat.

14:46.100 --> 14:47.440
Tsundere...

14:47.440 --> 14:51.310
And you can only use 
your magic once a day.

14:51.310 --> 14:54.410
I need to sleep to 
replenish my magic power.

14:54.640 --> 14:57.180
I hate living like this.

14:57.180 --> 15:00.220
I'll need you to become a first-class 
magician by the time you graduate.

15:00.220 --> 15:02.380
How can I do that?

15:02.370 --> 15:06.370
FOURTH-CLASS
EARN A MAGICIAN CERTIFICATE HERE

15:02.720 --> 15:06.450
Qualify for first class in the annual 
rating exam at the royal palace.

15:06.370 --> 15:10.370
THIRD-CLASS

15:06.780 --> 15:10.300
Only 0.005% of magicians make it.

15:10.300 --> 15:15.680
Only one person from Diana has ever 
made it, even as prestigious as it is.

15:10.370 --> 15:14.370
SECOND-CLASS

15:14.370 --> 15:18.350
FIRST-CLASS
0.005% OF MAGICIANS

15:15.680 --> 15:18.350
That's so slim! That person 
must have been amazing!

15:18.350 --> 15:19.620
That was me.

15:19.620 --> 15:21.890
Damn it! I complimented him by accident!

15:21.890 --> 15:24.500
In any case, over the next three years,

15:24.500 --> 15:26.670
your aim is to become the 
top student in your year.

15:26.670 --> 15:27.870
Top student?!

15:27.870 --> 15:31.150
You aren't going to make it 
to first-class otherwise.

15:31.540 --> 15:35.230
And you'll be expelled if your 
grades fall behind. Be careful.

15:35.580 --> 15:40.690
Per Diana policy, the bottom 10% 
gets kicked out every year.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.570
Don't get too cocky.

15:42.570 --> 15:43.660
Okay.

15:43.920 --> 15:45.110
Let's go to school.

15:45.750 --> 15:47.730
Good morning, Dorm Mother.

15:47.730 --> 15:48.760
You animal!

15:48.760 --> 15:51.250
I mean, good morning, Mr. Claude!

15:51.560 --> 15:53.210
Clandestine meetings in the morning...

15:53.210 --> 15:55.340
Indecent relationship between 
teacher and student...

15:55.340 --> 15:56.470
This is a scandal!

15:56.790 --> 16:00.230
Expulsion? There's no way 
that'll happen to me.

16:00.230 --> 16:02.940
I can't wait for my new school life!

16:03.290 --> 16:05.980
Gacrux, the north school wing.

16:05.980 --> 16:09.270
Here, students join with 
those from other covens

16:07.410 --> 16:09.740
Two masses are pulled toward 
each other with a strength

16:09.270 --> 16:11.850
to take classes in fundamental 
subjects such as astronomy.

16:09.740 --> 16:12.300
inversely proportionate to 
the square of their distance.

16:12.120 --> 16:15.860
The teacher's so fast! I can't keep up!

16:12.300 --> 16:15.870
This is called the law 
of universal gravitation.

16:15.870 --> 16:18.970
The strength of this 
gravity is denoted by F,

16:18.130 --> 16:20.530
This girl next to me is sound asleep!

16:18.970 --> 16:22.170
the masses of each object are 
denoted by M and m respectively,

16:20.530 --> 16:22.710
Hey, you should wake up.

16:22.170 --> 16:25.040
and the distance is represented 
by r in an equation.

16:22.710 --> 16:24.260
The teacher's glaring!

16:24.260 --> 16:25.350
Wake up!

16:25.350 --> 16:27.730
Spica Virgo! No chit-chat!

16:27.730 --> 16:28.460
Me?!

16:28.460 --> 16:31.590
Tell me the equation for 
universal gravitation!

16:32.070 --> 16:34.200
I explained it just now.

16:34.200 --> 16:36.090
If you were listening, you should know!

16:36.090 --> 16:38.060
Help me!

16:38.400 --> 16:42.170
F = GMm/r².

16:42.170 --> 16:44.400
Correct, Ewe Aries.

16:44.400 --> 16:46.970
Remember that, Spica Virgo!

16:46.970 --> 16:48.200
Y-Yes, sir.

16:48.740 --> 16:50.270
I wasn't expecting that.

16:50.270 --> 16:52.230
You're really smart, aren't you?

16:53.090 --> 16:54.650
She's asleep again!

16:55.000 --> 16:57.480
She answered it without even being awake.

16:57.480 --> 17:00.050
Meanwhile, I can't keep up at all!

17:00.050 --> 17:02.800
Am I actually stupid?

17:05.330 --> 17:07.710
In my class, I teach practical magic.

17:08.070 --> 17:11.510
Today, we'll be assessing your abilities

17:11.510 --> 17:15.170
by having you capture the most 
lophorns within 30 minutes.

17:15.470 --> 17:17.730
They may look cute, 
but they're destructive animals.

17:17.730 --> 17:20.640
Normal people have a 
hard time catching them,

17:20.640 --> 17:23.530
but my capable Diana students 
ought to have no trouble.

17:23.530 --> 17:27.260
I'm sure we won't have any slowpokes
who can't catch a single one.

17:27.260 --> 17:29.510
That's some brutal pressure!

17:29.510 --> 17:30.670
Begin!

17:31.990 --> 17:34.850
Spica, are you sure you can catch them?

17:34.850 --> 17:38.950
Have you forgotten how beautifully 
I caught that golem?

17:38.950 --> 17:40.710
A few bunnies aren't going
to be a problem!

17:40.710 --> 17:42.550
I'm aiming for the top!

17:42.550 --> 17:44.400
Virgo Magic: Anima!

17:48.070 --> 17:49.540
No way! It's so fast!

17:49.540 --> 17:51.500
I can't even touch it!

17:51.500 --> 17:54.090
Lophorns use their horns 
to detect magic power.

17:54.090 --> 17:57.410
They run away the moment they 
sense even a little magic.

17:57.410 --> 17:59.170
Let's see how they deal with them.

17:59.390 --> 18:01.260
What a waste of time...

18:01.880 --> 18:04.980
Scorpio Magic: Fog Scorpion.

18:08.070 --> 18:11.030
I've paralyzed you for a bit.

18:11.460 --> 18:14.530
Blame the teacher, not me.

18:14.770 --> 18:17.450
She released a paralyzing toxin.

18:17.450 --> 18:18.670
Not bad.

18:18.670 --> 18:21.290
There's no way they can get away, 
even if they can detect it.

18:21.290 --> 18:25.000
But the collateral damage is a problem.

18:25.570 --> 18:28.150
Cancer Magic: Fulad Qafas!

18:33.680 --> 18:35.200
They're so cute.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.600
Wow.

18:36.600 --> 18:38.370
One fell swoop.

18:38.370 --> 18:40.960
I have to use Anima over a wide area...

18:41.250 --> 18:45.200
No, they'll get away while 
I'm waiting to activate it.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.370
Expulsion.

18:46.940 --> 18:48.430
I have to hurry.

18:52.080 --> 18:53.570
Good work.

18:53.570 --> 18:55.080
Now for the results.

18:55.080 --> 18:57.860
In first place: Aria Aquarius, 
who caught ten.

18:59.100 --> 19:00.690
Easy.

19:00.690 --> 19:03.850
In last place: Spica Virgo with zero.

19:05.420 --> 19:09.620
I got headbutted by a lophorn, 
and when I came to, it was over.

19:09.620 --> 19:13.040
Well, that was too bad, Spica!

19:13.040 --> 19:15.330
The hell are you doing?!
Have you no sense, either?!

19:16.260 --> 19:18.760
We'll have remedial lessons after school.

19:19.130 --> 19:21.290
You're going to get expelled at this rate!

19:21.290 --> 19:22.660
Do you understand?

19:24.660 --> 19:26.090
Yes.

19:36.700 --> 19:38.350
What do I do?

19:38.350 --> 19:40.530
It's my first day, and I'm 
already falling behind.

19:41.270 --> 19:44.140
I thought I could do a little better.

19:44.740 --> 19:47.150
Never mind being top of my year...

19:47.150 --> 19:50.120
What if I really get expelled?

19:53.650 --> 19:55.290
You're late.

19:55.290 --> 19:58.390
You're slow because you stare at 
the ground and drag your feet.

19:58.890 --> 20:01.610
Did you call me here to scold me?

20:01.610 --> 20:04.720
We could have done remedial 
lessons in your office.

20:05.360 --> 20:06.590
What is this place?

20:06.590 --> 20:08.090
An observatory.

20:08.090 --> 20:09.990
Diana has several of them.

20:09.990 --> 20:11.560
Huh.

20:11.560 --> 20:13.810
You can even use them like this.

20:14.960 --> 20:19.060
I cast visualization and levitation 
magic on the entire room.

20:19.060 --> 20:21.750
They let you create a virtual 
recreation of space.

20:23.050 --> 20:24.700
The stars are so pretty!

20:24.940 --> 20:26.310
That's Deneb.

20:26.310 --> 20:27.210
Altair.

20:27.210 --> 20:28.200
Vega.

20:28.200 --> 20:31.470
That big, blueish-white one is Spica.

20:31.470 --> 20:32.560
I know.

20:32.560 --> 20:34.760
That's the one with my name.

20:34.760 --> 20:37.310
Spica may look like one star,

20:37.310 --> 20:42.200
but it's actually two stars spinning 
so rapidly that they look like one.

20:42.630 --> 20:46.040
What is this, an astronomy class?

20:46.040 --> 20:51.400
The light they produce is said to 
be 20,000 times that of the Sun.

20:51.400 --> 20:52.520
Wow.

20:52.930 --> 20:57.580
The point is, well, even if one can 
only produce so much light,

20:57.580 --> 21:01.120
two together can produce incredible power.

21:02.960 --> 21:06.210
Are you trying to cheer me up?

21:06.210 --> 21:11.040
Are you telling me I'll be all 
right because I'm not alone?

21:11.520 --> 21:12.440
What?!

21:12.440 --> 21:13.880
Obviously not!

21:21.140 --> 21:23.660
I feel better after laughing.

21:24.040 --> 21:27.070
And what's so funny? Tell me.

21:28.050 --> 21:29.890
I'm sorry!

21:30.590 --> 21:34.840
I didn't think he'd look out 
for me like this, though.

21:35.680 --> 21:38.240
I feel like I could really become

21:38.240 --> 21:41.640
a first-class magician 
with Professor Claude.

21:42.690 --> 21:44.620
That's enough silliness.

21:44.620 --> 21:45.840
Time for remedial lessons!

21:46.270 --> 21:49.190
You aren't going home until 
you catch twelve lophorns!

21:49.840 --> 21:51.120
And if I can't?

21:51.120 --> 21:51.960
You're staying overnight.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.690
You monster!

23:25.150 --> 23:28.590
I hear Castor Gemini skips your 
classes and your classes only.

23:28.830 --> 23:31.830
You know what happens 
if he drops out, yes?

23:31.830 --> 23:32.920
Principal...

23:32.920 --> 23:35.250
Next episode: "Castor Gemini's Fate."

23:35.250 --> 23:36.980
Are you getting fired?!

23:35.510 --> 23:39.960
EPISODE 4
CASTOR GEMINI'S FATE

23:36.980 --> 23:38.250
Help me out.

23:38.250 --> 23:39.550
I'll give you pudding!
